Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.80,0:00:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉丝 我杀了她 并且释放了路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith, what's the funny see. I killed her, and I set Lucifer free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背弃了兄弟 选择了恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose a demon over your own brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.11,0:00:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经无法再信任你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't think I can trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.28,0:00:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我仍会禁不住诱惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'll take one look at a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.08,0:00:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到恶魔就会想扑上去吸血\N{\fnArial\fs30}And suddenly fall off the wagon,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.59,0:00:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经吃一堑了 难道还不会长一智\N{\fnArial\fs30}As if, after everything, I haven't learned my lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 真长了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.29,0:00:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道你不再信任我了 - 什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know you don't trust me. - So, what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.13,0:00:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许分开行动对咱俩会更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's best we just go our separate ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.60,0:00:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.97,0:00:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道我是谁 - 路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know who I am. - Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,非你莫属 萨姆 专属于我的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one, Sam. you're my vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.10,0:00:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,想都别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll never happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.55,0:00:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是米迦勒之剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the michael sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.61,0:00:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是剑 什么意思 - 你是米迦勒的利器\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean, I'm the sword? - You're michael's weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.61,0:00:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 意思就是我是皮囊吗 - 你是独一无二的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm a vessel? - You're the vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.06,0:00:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,想回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want back in…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.02,0:00:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我绝不会让你失望的 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I won't let you down. - Oh, I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.31,0:00:51.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.69,0:00:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 伙计 到底有什么重要的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, buddy, what's so important.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.04,0:00:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能在手机上说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't tell me over the phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.24,0:01:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 吉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, Jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.04,0:01:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这绝对万分重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.31,0:01:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你不会是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. you're not …
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.92,0:01:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟我说这就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not telling me that this is…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.92,0:01:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 你找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yep. - You found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.24,0:01:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,小贱货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little Bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.03,0:01:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh, you found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,偶 滴 神 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…my…god.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.84,0:01:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.24,0:01:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是比赛时的车牌号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vin number's a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.48,0:01:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,花了多少银子啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much did you pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.78,0:01:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一大笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.91,0:01:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 快说是多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. how much?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.21,0:01:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,很大一笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.58,0:01:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是肯定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.83,0:01:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没发动过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You start her up yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.19,0:01:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就等着你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.46,0:01:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 是想在我面前好好炫耀一番吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, waiting to rub my nose in it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.13,0:01:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,真了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.67,0:01:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 先等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.53,0:01:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种历史性的时刻一定得录下来才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to record this for posterity's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.74,0:02:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.90,0:02:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.44,0:02:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.01,0:02:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,评论家称其为诱骗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The critics call it a blockbust…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.43,0:02:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.93,0:02:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 嘿 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cal?! Hey, you all right, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.27,0:02:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似我听到什么声音了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I heard something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.74,0:02:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 出什么事儿了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cal, there's something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.95,0:02:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,偶滴神啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.89,0:02:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cal!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 这次是什么活儿来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's with this job?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,有钱公子哥儿竟把头猛撞向停得纹丝不动的汽车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude suffers a head-on collision in a parked car?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.82,0:03:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这绝对值得我们一探究竟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say that's worth checking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.52,0:03:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.32,0:03:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们还有更重要的问题要解决 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, but we got bigger problems, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.36,0:03:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想天启绝不会自己长脚跑掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure the apocalypse will still be there when we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.45,0:03:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 话是没错 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, yeah, but, I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.26,0:03:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果科尔特枪真的流落在外的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the Colt is really out there somewhere …
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.72,0:03:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们已经找了整整三个星期了 还是一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we've been looking for three weeks. we got bupkus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.34,0:03:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.41,0:03:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.07,0:03:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们想干掉恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if we're gonna ice the devil …
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.93,0:03:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这不就正在干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what we're doing, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.55,0:03:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,争论到此结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}End of discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.73,0:03:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是我们再在一起之后的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that this is our first real case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.86,0:03:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一件真真切切的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back at it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.69,0:03:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们都该放松点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I think we ought to ease into it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.79,0:04:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,借此重新找回默契\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the training wheels back on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.46,0:04:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你觉得我需要重新训练下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you think I need training wheels?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.50,0:04:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是我们 我们都需要重新训练下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No."we." we need training wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.50,0:04:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我 作为一体\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me, as a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.80,0:04:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.27,0:04:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.54,0:04:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的希望这是一次新的开始 了解吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I really want this to be a fresh start, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.91,0:04:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是对我们俩而言\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.39,0:04:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.38,0:04:41.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（坎顿 俄亥俄州）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.20,0:04:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员博纳姆和科普兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agents Bonham and Copeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.97,0:04:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克·卡内基 很高兴见到你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick Carnegie. Good to know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.59,0:04:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们是来调查卡尔·霍普金斯的死亡原因的 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you're here on account of Cal Hopkins' death? - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.54,0:04:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那恐怕真是有的查了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, afraid you came a long way for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.35,0:04:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经抓到凶手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We already booked the guy that did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.22,0:04:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 你说是谁干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. who do you think did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.95,0:04:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 怎么了 天啊 卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cal, something wrong? God…Cal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个变态拍下了自己的杰作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sicko taped his own handiwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.50,0:05:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不太明白你的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.14,0:05:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吉姆·格罗斯曼杀了卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Jim Grossman that killed cal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.91,0:05:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.44,0:05:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是方圆百里内唯一在现场的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he was the only one on the scene for miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.28,0:05:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.38,0:05:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,大多数暴力犯罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most violent crimes are committed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.85,0:05:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,都发生在密友之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}By someone close to the victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.35,0:05:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔是被时速80英里的冲击撞到挡风玻璃上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how exactly did Jim slam Cal into a windshield.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.32,0:05:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆到底是怎么做到的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all the force of an 80-mile-per-hour crash?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.02,0:05:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概是嗑了药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drugs, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.92,0:05:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 要知道这又不是脑手术 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you know this ain't brain surgery, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.56,0:05:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真相通常就是表面看上去的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it looks like, that's what it usually is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单明了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.06,0:05:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,「简单明了」 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"simple." right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.88,0:05:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.63,0:05:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, if you don't mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.94,0:05:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是想和吉姆·格罗斯曼谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd like to speak to Jim Grossman anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.14,0:05:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我正在屋子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in the house when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.77,0:05:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至什么都没看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't even see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.04,0:05:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,为方便起见 我们其实是相信你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for argument's sake, say we believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.24,0:05:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 警察可不信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you? the cops didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.61,0:05:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是普通的警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not your typical cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.98,0:05:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,请告诉我们你看见了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, just tell us what you saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.65,0:05:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看见 而是听见有动静\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not what I saw. it's what I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.15,0:06:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮胎刺耳的摩擦和玻璃打碎的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tires squealing, glass breaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.66,0:06:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那辆车干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the car that did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.73,0:06:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,车\N{\fnArial\fs30}The car?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.79,0:06:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指 我听说过有关诅咒的传闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I heard about the curse,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.20,0:06:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我一直不以为然\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I just thought it was a load of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.80,0:06:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,诅咒 什么诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curse? what do you mean, curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.57,0:06:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那辆车的诅咒 小贱货\N{\fnArial\fs30}The car. little bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.60,0:06:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,小 小贱货\N{\fnArial\fs30}L-little bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是在车里被杀的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in the little bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.67,0:06:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什么是「小贱货」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait. what's little bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.04,0:06:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是詹姆士·迪恩的车 他就在车里被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's James Dean's car. it's the one he was killed in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.28,0:06:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 就是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.71,0:06:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔已经找寻了多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cal had been looking for it for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.05,0:06:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 见鬼的 我们都找了很多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, hell, we both had.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.18,0:06:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他先找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he found it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.39,0:06:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须得查清楚这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we are definitely checking this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.09,0:06:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个就像是「妖车克里斯汀」的故事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what this is like the "Christine"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.80,0:06:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 「妖车克里斯汀」只是小说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, "Christine" is fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.56,0:06:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这\N{\fnArial\fs30}This …
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.10,0:06:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是千真万确的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.47,0:06:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那就说来听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. enlighten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.07,0:06:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆士·迪恩去世后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, after James Dean died,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.04,0:06:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的机械师买下了汽车残骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}His mechanic bought the wreckage,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.88,0:07:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新修理好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he fixed it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.95,0:07:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但结果就是他被这辆车压死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it repaid him by falling on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.62,0:07:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后是托尼·麦凯亨利被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then Tony Mchenry was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.05,0:07:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这辆车在赛道上自动上锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it locked up on the racetrack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.68,0:07:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指 死亡如同尾气一般缠绕着这辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, death follows this car around like exhaust.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.55,0:07:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都对她敬而远之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody touches it and comes away in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.86,0:07:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到1970年 她从卡车的车厢内消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then in 1970, it vanished off the back of a truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.63,0:07:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从那时起 就再也没人见过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's ever seen it since.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.23,0:07:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 老弟 如果\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, man. if this …
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.47,0:07:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这辆车就是那辆小贱货\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this car is little bastard,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.90,0:07:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定就是她杀了那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will bet you dollars to doughnuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.40,0:07:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我赌啥都成\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what killed the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.70,0:07:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那我们怎么查\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how do we find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.17,0:07:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔曾说汽车识别代码是吻合的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Cal matched the vin number,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.54,0:07:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但只有通过引擎代码才能知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the only real way to know is the engine number.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.55,0:07:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想引擎代码应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing the engine number …
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.01,0:07:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在引擎上的 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the engine. yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.26,0:07:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.59,0:07:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.59,0:07:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 我能搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, i've g… i've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.10,0:07:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, baby…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.13,0:07:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会伤害你的 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna hurt you, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.30,0:08:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也别害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.13,0:08:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,要手电筒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need a flashlight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.37,0:08:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.50,0:08:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥都别做 快走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do anything. just go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.74,0:08:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 呃 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You … uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.74,0:08:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别出声 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't speak, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.46,0:08:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,也别盯着她看 她可能会不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, don't even look at her. she might not like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.52,0:09:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,查出之前的车主来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find out who owned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.82,0:09:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不止是上一任车主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just the last owner…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.49,0:09:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得一直追查到1955年\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to take it all the way back to 1955.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.46,0:09:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样调查工作量很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a lot of research.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.94,0:09:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你今天下午有事做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess I just made your afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.97,0:09:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么说你想当演员\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you want to be an actress, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.37,0:09:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可巧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is …that is so funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.14,0:09:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I am actually…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.17,0:09:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉·莫里斯公司的经纪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}An agent for William Morris Endeavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.58,0:09:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,再帮我满上好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind filling me up again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.56,0:09:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是明星 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you're a star, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.12,0:09:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,花了些工夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, took me a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.22,0:09:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我追查了所有的前车主\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I traced all the car's previous owners.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.02,0:09:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们中有没有人是横死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any of them die bloody?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.90,0:10:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 实际上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. In fact…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.13,0:10:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你在酒吧吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, are you in a bar?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.80,0:10:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我在 我在餐馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm …I'm in a restaurant…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.66,0:10:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's your beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.00,0:10:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.17,0:10:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家餐馆碰巧有吧台\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that happens to have a bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.97,0:10:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这边忙得要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been working my ass off here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.11,0:10:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,同病相怜 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, world's smallest violin, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.87,0:10:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我查克里斯汀查了一下午\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent the afternoon up Christine's skirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.01,0:10:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.05,0:10:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实用不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.02,0:10:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.80,0:10:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个车主是费城的一位心脏病专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}The car's first owner was a cardiologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.18,0:10:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到1972年去世他一直开着这部车\N{\fnArial\fs30}In philadelphia …drove it till he died in 1972.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.29,0:10:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're saying…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.65,0:10:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这辆保时捷从来就不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That porsche is not, nor has it ever been,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.26,0:10:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·迪恩的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Dean's car.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.59,0:10:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这辆「小贱货」是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a fake little bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.19,0:10:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那么人是什么杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, what was it that killed the guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.93,0:10:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.24,0:10:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 希尔先生 我完事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Mr. Hill. I finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.77,0:10:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 康斯薇拉 祝你今晚过得愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Consuela. Have a good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.65,0:11:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.99,0:11:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.21,0:11:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.13,0:11:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.97,0:11:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.40,0:11:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.51,0:11:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.89,0:11:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要仔细搜索\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to use a fine-tooth comb.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.39,0:11:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,证据就在这里 我们只需要找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}The evidence is here. Just got to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.89,0:11:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你又遇上奇案了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard you got another weird one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.36,0:11:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,表 表面上看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's a …it's a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有点儿奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange on the surface…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.03,0:11:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但只要看看证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you know, once y-you look at the facts…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.34,0:11:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉·希尔死于头部中弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}William Hill died from a gunshot wound to the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.21,0:11:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有枪支 没有火药 没有子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}No gun, no gunpowder, no bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.31,0:11:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 但也没什么奇怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. Nothin' strange about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.55,0:12:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,总该有个合乎逻辑的解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's got to be a reasonable explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.62,0:12:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There always is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.85,0:12:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你合乎逻辑的解释是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what's your reasonable explanation?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.59,0:12:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,职业杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professional killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.96,0:12:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,中情局 国家安全局 他们有一伙特训刺客\N{\fnArial\fs30}CIA, NSA, one of them trained assassins…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.66,0:12:15.29,Title,0,0,0,0,,就像《迈克尔·克莱顿》里演的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like in "Michael Clayton".
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.87,0:12:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,太对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.17,0:12:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以随意看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome to look around, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.94,0:12:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这些人不留指纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}But these guys don't leave fingerprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.74,0:12:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不介意我们跟目击证人谈谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind if we talk with the witness?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.01,0:12:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,随意 她讲的话毫无道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, be my guest. She's not making any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.78,0:12:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是懂西班牙语也听不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she's not making any sense in Spanish, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.15,0:12:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.71,0:12:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语] 我不能住在这 我有自己的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}No puedo vivir aqu? Necesito mI familia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.42,0:12:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在要回去 我要回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me voy ahora. Me voy a la casa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.42,0:12:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我家在萨尔瓦多\N{\fnArial\fs30}No… Me voy a la casa en el salvador ahora.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.59,0:12:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,康斯薇拉·阿尔瓦雷茨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consuela Alvarez?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.99,0:12:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.13,0:12:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,联调局\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.00,0:12:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你看到有什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you said you saw something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.93,0:12:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在教授房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the professor's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.20,0:12:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 从窗户里看见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right? Something in the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.47,0:12:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时正在倒垃圾桶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Estaba sacando la basura.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语] 然后？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y luego.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.02,0:13:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语] 女士 不要怕 慢慢说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No tengas miedo de hablar despacio.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.67,0:13:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语] 那个人什么样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Como era ese hombre?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.61,0:13:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.95,0:13:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,大学一年级学的西班牙语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freshman Spanish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.15,0:13:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很高 非常高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Era alto, muy alto.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.85,0:13:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿着黑色长外套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y llevaba el abrigo negro largo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.02,0:13:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.09,0:13:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个男人 非常高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tall man. Very tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.79,0:13:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿了一件长黑袍\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a long black coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.46,0:13:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有大胡子对吧 有胡子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, a beard? beard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一顶帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y un sombrero.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.60,0:13:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个戴墨西哥帽的男人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude was wearing a sombrero?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.17,0:13:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是一顶帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-a hat. not a-a …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.57,0:13:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的 是很高的那种帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. un sombrero alto.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.34,0:13:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 高顶帽吗 - 应该是顶帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A tall hat? oh, - Like a top hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.41,0:13:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那种高帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iun sombrero alto!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.68,0:13:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Muy alto.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.78,0:13:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you mean like a …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.65,0:13:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有点像大礼帽吗 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like a stovepipe hat? - Si?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.22,0:13:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了 和亚伯拉罕·林肯很像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, you know, like abraham lincoln.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.98,0:13:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 就是林肯总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Si? el presidente lincoln.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.92,0:13:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯拉罕·林肯杀了希尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abraham lincoln killed mr. hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.46,0:13:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在能回家了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-so I go home now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.07,0:14:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 十分感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, si? gracias.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.70,0:14:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gracias.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.82,0:14:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.86,0:14:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是金·罗斯曼视频里的定格画面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's a freeze-frame from jim grossman's video.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.10,0:14:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我疯了还是里面那人真得很像詹姆斯·迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I crazy, or does that look like james dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.81,0:14:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去挺像詹姆斯·迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That looks like james dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.61,0:14:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在疑犯有亚伯拉罕·林肯和詹姆斯·迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we got abraham lincoln and james dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.45,0:14:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是名人鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Famous ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.95,0:14:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.48,0:14:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's just silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.15,0:14:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 实际上 名人鬼魂数不胜数\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, actually, uh, there's a ton of lore on famous ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.76,0:14:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至比平民鬼魂多\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than the, you know, not-famous kinds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.76,0:15:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是很好奇之前一次都没碰到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm actually surprised we haven't run into one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.03,0:15:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀 现在就来了2个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but now we got two of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.26,0:15:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,2个极度愤怒的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}two extremely pissed off ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.53,0:15:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 显然是鬼魂在和粉丝套近乎 - 此话怎讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are apparently ganking their fans. - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.20,0:15:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,希尔教授对于美国内战深有造诣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor hill was a civil war nut.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.57,0:15:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是林肯的拥护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}He dug lincoln.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.84,0:15:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那卡尔一定是詹姆斯·迪恩的拥趸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And cal must have been a james dean freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.11,0:15:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他花了整整17年的时间来寻找偶像拥有的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}He spent 17 years of his life tracking down the guy's car.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.21,0:15:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说这次我们遇到的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're saying that we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.88,0:15:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,2个超级有名 超级愤怒的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two super-famous, super-pissed-off ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.45,0:15:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀害自己的超级粉丝咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing their super fans?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.15,0:15:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.55,0:15:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也太异想天开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that is muchos loco.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.42,0:15:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该用「muy」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"muy".
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.29,0:15:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是「muchos」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not "muchos".
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.89,0:15:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 至关重要的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, the big question is,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.26,0:15:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们下一步该怎么走\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are they doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.00,0:15:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 鬼魂通常在生前的故居周围出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, ghosts usually haunt the places they lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.97,0:15:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说 亚伯拉罕·林肯住在白宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I get abraham lincoln at the white house.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.90,0:15:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·迪恩待在赛车场 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And james dean at a racetrack, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.64,0:15:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们到坎顿来做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are they doing in canton?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.72,0:16:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.82,0:16:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.63,0:16:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.75,0:16:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,老弟 他好矮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude he is short.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.72,0:16:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘地可是位伟人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gandhi was a great man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.13,0:16:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像蓝精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, for a smurf.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.46,0:16:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉让你们久等了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.03,0:16:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是我们一年里最忙的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our busiest time of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.50,0:16:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还算忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is busy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.24,0:16:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是现在 还早着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-well, n-not right now. but it's early.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.14,0:16:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,都4点半了\N{\fnArial\fs30}4:30.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.71,0:16:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么能为您效劳的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.44,0:16:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在撰写一份旅行杂志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we are writing a piece for travel magazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.58,0:17:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 寻找最货真价实的蜡像馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, on how totally non-sucky wax museums are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.01,0:17:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.22,0:17:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些媒体的宣传 这正是我们需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little press … just what we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.62,0:17:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那太好了 我们对你们馆一些展品比较感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, well, we're interested in a few of your exhibits,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是亚伯拉罕·林肯和詹姆斯·迪恩那两尊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Specifically abraham lincoln and james dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.36,0:17:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们馆最受欢迎的展品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two of our most popular displays.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.79,0:17:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 这么说吸引了很多游客咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah? so they bring in a lot of visitors?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.19,0:17:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 有很多常客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we have our regulars.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.26,0:17:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,该不会恰巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.66,0:17:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉·希尔和卡尔·霍普金斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That william hill and cal hopkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.33,0:17:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你们的常客吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were regulars, were they?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.66,0:17:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a matter of fact, they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.17,0:17:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说了他们的事 太悲惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard what happened to them. that's tragic, just tragic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.80,0:17:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个不会写到文章里去吧 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's not gonna be in the article, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.34,0:17:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. no, no. of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.77,0:17:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I got to tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.54,0:17:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那尊林肯的蜡像 太逼真了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That … that lincoln is so lifelike.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.91,0:17:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是如此的栩栩如生 简直像能活动一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you know, you can just imagine him moving around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.15,0:17:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过那样的没\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever see anything like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.09,0:17:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.42,0:17:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得 有没有什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, is there anything you can think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.76,0:17:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,会令你的博物馆不同寻常\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would make your museum…unusual?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.23,0:17:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了写文章\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, for the article.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.10,0:17:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢说 这世上绝对没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, i'll say. there isn't another.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.52,0:17:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二个像我这里的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}place like us,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.73,0:17:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么 - 这帽子是林肯的真品\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How so? - Well, for one, that's honest abe's real hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.40,0:17:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.77,0:18:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是他的遗物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost like his remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.18,0:18:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh. I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.64,0:18:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会恰好有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't happen to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.45,0:18:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·迪恩的遗物吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any of james dean's personal effects, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.42,0:18:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 有个他的钥匙链\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, got his key chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.15,0:18:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有好多这样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a bunch of stuff …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.59,0:18:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘地的双光眼镜 罗斯福的人工呼吸器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, gandhi's bifocals, fdr's iron lung,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.62,0:18:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.76,0:18:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谁的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who did that belong to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.13,0:18:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,方兹（美国著名科幻演员）从第二季到第四季\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fonzie seasons 2 through 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.73,0:18:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这倒是挺酷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's … that's really cool…ish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.33,0:18:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this? this is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.67,0:18:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在收集一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been working on a new collection of figures,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.94,0:18:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够让孩子们惊呼的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuff that'll really wow the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.30,0:18:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 孩子 - “Y世代”的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The kids? - Yeah, Gen "Y".
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.34,0:18:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑游戏 手机 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computer games, cellphones, "sexting" …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.01,0:18:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦特工的那些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just fads.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.91,0:18:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让蜡像馆再度风靡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna make wax museums hip again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.27,0:19:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯拉罕·林肯和詹姆斯·迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, abraham lincoln and james dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.37,0:19:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.91,0:19:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,为啥那么疯狂的想杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why so kill-crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.48,0:19:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许天启导致这一切吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, maybe the apocalypse has got them all hot and bothered.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.15,0:19:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 大家都知道这是谁的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, we all know whose fault that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.08,0:19:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 我会留意他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, i'm keeping an eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.92,0:19:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头打给你 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call you later. bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.22,0:19:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.56,0:19:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打包好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get the trunk packed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.06,0:19:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 都扔后备箱了 你跟谁在打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the trunk's packed. who was on the phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.33,0:19:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲍比 - 然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bobby. - And?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.00,0:19:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.33,0:19:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就假装没听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we're just gonna pretend i.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.43,0:19:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才我所听到的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}didn't hear what I just heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.10,0:19:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱装不装 随你便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretend or don't pretend, whatever floats your boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.47,0:19:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不应该是个崭新的开始吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was supposed to be a fresh start, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.34,0:19:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 这不就是崭新了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is about as fresh as it gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.18,0:19:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底走不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we going or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.88,0:20:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.35,0:20:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,87年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four score and seven years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.95,0:20:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个搞笑的帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a funny hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.79,0:20:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.96,0:20:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能玩玩这个么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't have any fun with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.82,0:20:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,把东西烧了 连鬼魂也一起烧掉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just torch the objects, torch the ghosts,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.23,0:20:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后闪人 好不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And get out of here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.49,0:20:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去拿「伊甸园之东」的钥匙扣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go grab "east of eden's" key chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.24,0:21:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.68,0:21:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.65,0:22:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.99,0:22:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是甘地吗 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that gandhi?! - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.66,0:22:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 他真是个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, he's squirrelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.09,0:22:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the …
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.43,0:22:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.73,0:22:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.26,0:22:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能崇拜些比较酷的人么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't have been a fan of someone cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.65,0:22:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的假的 甘地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? gandhi?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.64,0:22:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备闪人没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready to blow this joint?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.31,0:22:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你不觉得有些奇怪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, didn't it strike you as strange,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.95,0:23:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘地消失的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way gandhi just vanished?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.25,0:23:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange how?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.48,0:23:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没尖叫 没火烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No screaming, no big flameout.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.02,0:23:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是通常鬼魂消失的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that isn't the way ghosts usually go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.42,0:23:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我烧 他消失 搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still … I torched, he vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.86,0:23:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,话没错 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but I …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.22,0:23:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我觉得他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, I feel like he was…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.74,0:23:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要咬我一口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took e a bite out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.64,0:23:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,咬你\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bite?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.22,0:23:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 就好像他很饿一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, like he was hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.85,0:23:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是问题是 真的甘地\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the thing is, gandhi … or the real gandhi …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.93,0:23:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.16,0:23:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}A what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.11,0:23:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spit it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.96,0:23:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是果食主义者\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a fruitarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.44,0:23:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来理一下思绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.07,0:23:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你崇拜的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your ultimate hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.17,0:23:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅是一个穿着麻布衣的矮子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was not only a short man in diapers,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.11,0:23:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是个果食主义者\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he was also a fruitarian?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.11,0:23:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不是重点 - 这没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not the point. - That is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.95,0:23:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说 这已经很不错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is … even for you, that is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.55,0:23:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是觉得这事不会轻易结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, i'm just saying i'm not so sure this thing is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.32,0:23:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,它只是个幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.22,0:23:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是个超级古怪的果食主义幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a weirdly supercharged fruitarian ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.96,0:23:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到底还是个幽灵 好吧 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was still a ghost. now let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.23,0:23:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 首先你强拉我进小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, first, you drag me into town,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.76,0:23:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又活生生的把我拖出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you're dragging me back out?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.56,0:23:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是死脑筋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't steering this boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.73,0:24:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. chop-chop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.60,0:24:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不适合一起干下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this isn't gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.87,0:24:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What isn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.34,0:24:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们 你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us. you, me … together.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.07,0:24:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为可以 但这不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it could, but it can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.01,0:24:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你想回来的哦 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one that wanted back in, chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.01,0:24:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过让我回来的可是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're the one who called me back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.63,0:24:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仍觉得我们该做一些建立信任的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still think we got some trust-building to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.38,0:24:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还要多久才能换回你的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long am I gonna be on double-secret probation?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.83,0:24:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until I say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.32,0:24:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我过去的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look… I know what I did, What i've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.92,0:24:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在努力爬出这个深渊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am trying to climb out of that hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.93,0:24:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坚信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.06,0:24:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你让这变得困难重重\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not making it any easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.43,0:24:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望我忘掉你过去的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, am I supposed to just let you off the hook?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.33,0:24:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你想怎么样都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. you can think whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.57,0:24:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应当接受惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I deserve it and worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.44,0:24:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我的惩罚还没我对我自己的多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, you'll never punish me as much as i'm punish myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.57,0:24:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the point is,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.84,0:24:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我和你是一体\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're gonna be a team, you and i,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.21,0:24:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那肯定是条双行道\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to be a two-way street.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.61,0:24:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得回到过去的老路\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we just go back to the way we were before?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.55,0:24:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 因为我们之前没有走过那路\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, because we were never that way before.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.48,0:24:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有干活之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}"before" didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.65,0:24:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这儿是为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you think we got here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.42,0:24:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那应该是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.32,0:25:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 当时和露比走的唯一理由是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, one of the reasons I went off with ruby…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.27,0:25:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是远离你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was to get away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.80,0:25:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.84,0:25:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我变得很强\N{\fnArial\fs30}It made me feel strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.40,0:25:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,变得不像是你的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I wasn't your kid brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.54,0:25:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有说过这是我的错么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you saying this is my fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.24,0:25:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 错的是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.14,0:25:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们干下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All i'm saying is that if we're gonna do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.68,0:25:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得与众不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to do it different.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.11,0:25:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能两次跨入同一条河流\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just fall into the same rut.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.01,0:25:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.02,0:25:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我崛起 从头开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to let me grow up, for starters.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.47,0:25:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 好的 马上到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.31,0:25:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这次你对了 这事儿没完\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you were right about this not being over.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.05,0:25:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡内基警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff carnegie.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.88,0:26:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.25,0:26:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.81,0:26:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.70,0:26:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰下 姑娘们 我们是联邦探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse us, girls. hi, we're with the fbi.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.40,0:26:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,能否告诉我们发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you tell us what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.37,0:26:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太恐怖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.37,0:26:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怖的不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.67,0:26:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was horrible?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.70,0:26:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得她是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought she'd be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.17,0:26:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在还不能相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.84,0:26:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.88,0:26:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,她杀死了丹妮尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took danielle!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.07,0:26:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.55,0:26:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怕 这很安全 把事情告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. you're safe. just tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.65,0:26:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁杀死了你们的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who took your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.65,0:26:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.92,0:26:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕丽斯·希尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paris hilton.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.96,0:26:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.92,0:26:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然她看起来真的很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}She looked really good, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.23,0:26:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,很苗条很放荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skinny. skinny and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.83,0:26:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, where did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.05,0:26:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.33,0:26:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.97,0:26:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不介意我们离开一会儿么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you excuse us for just a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.27,0:26:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕丽斯·希尔顿还没死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paris hilton's not dead, as far as we know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.58,0:26:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确信 没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty sure, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.84,0:27:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就意味着不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means it's not a…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.31,0:27:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鬼怪作怪 - 的确不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ghost. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.08,0:27:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以要么帕丽斯·希尔顿是杀人狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}So either Paris Hilton is a homicidal maniac or …
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.58,0:27:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么我们遗漏了某些细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we missed something.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.55,0:27:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.81,0:27:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whew! that's ripe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.00,0:27:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.00,0:28:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信我竟然遗漏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe I missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.37,0:28:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,遗漏了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missed what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.64,0:28:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细回顾下另两个受害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went back over the other two vics.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.31,0:28:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都大量失血\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was blood loss … major.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.68,0:28:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,正常啊 你要是被残忍杀害也会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, being a gory smear will do that to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.84,0:28:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 我是说失血量\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I mean more blood loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.31,0:28:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,远比车祸或是爆头要多得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Than a car crash or a head wound should cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.32,0:28:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,更像是 被人吸食了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost like… something's feeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.68,0:28:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 真恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.82,0:28:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 还发现了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then… there were these.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.55,0:28:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么 种子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are those, seeds?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.96,0:28:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 在受害人的肚子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they were in both vics' bellies.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.43,0:28:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你洗手了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you washed your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.06,0:28:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这跟我之前见过的种子不一样 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're unlike any other seed i've ever seen before, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.46,0:28:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你不会那么无趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, just when I thought you couldn't get any geekier.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.88,0:28:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yahtzee!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.28,0:28:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.15,0:28:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一带不产这种种子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The seeds aren't from around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.75,0:28:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 我国境内的树和植物也不结\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, they're not from any tree or plant in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.78,0:28:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是哪里产的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they from?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.45,0:28:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,东欧 巴尔干地区的密林里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eastern europe, from a forest in the balkans,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.52,0:28:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上那儿也不产了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is not even there anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.09,0:28:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,30年前这些树被砍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was chopped down like 30 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.76,0:28:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.19,0:28:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,当地有个传说 那片密林由一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, local legend has it that the forest was guarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.70,0:28:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,名字叫莱希的异教神所守护\N{\fnArial\fs30}By a pagan god whose name was leshii …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.46,0:29:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一个淘气的小神 可以千变万化\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mischievous god, could take on infinite forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.80,0:29:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我猜猜 他爱吃自己的粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let me guess … he liked to munch on his fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.77,0:29:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能通过吸食教徒之血\N{\fnArial\fs30}"could be appeased only with the.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.79,0:29:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,才得以满足\N{\fnArial\fs30}blood from his worhippers.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.74,0:29:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将他们吸干\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would drain them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.11,0:29:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后将种子放进他们胃里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then stuff their stomachs with the seeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.04,0:29:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么办到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's he doing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.01,0:29:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过触碰詹姆斯·迪恩的钥匙链\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, he touches james dean's key chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.95,0:29:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能摇身变为詹姆斯·迪恩了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then morphs into james dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.39,0:29:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有这种可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. that's good a guess as any.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.59,0:29:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 随便吧 关键是我们怎么才能杀掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, whatever. how do we kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.76,0:29:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这上面说用纯铁斧砍掉他的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says here to chop off his head with an iron ax.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.48,0:29:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.99,0:29:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去抓那个帕丽斯·希尔顿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go gank ourselves a paris hilton.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.51,0:30:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.08,0:30:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,活着 但气若悬丝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.53,0:31:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.00,0:31:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴你们及时醒过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so glad you're awake for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.51,0:32:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来的会更精彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna be huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.12,0:32:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 看来我不会错过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Super. I wouldn't want to miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.55,0:32:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我刚刚吃完\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, i've been stuffing myself with fast food lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.46,0:32:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便做个宗教仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's nice to do the ritual right,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.09,0:32:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许细细品尝 换换口味也不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare a nice, slow meal for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.96,0:32:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像过去一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like the good old days, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.03,0:32:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.60,0:32:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们崇敬我\N{\fnArial\fs30}People adored me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.87,0:32:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们过去常常微笑着\N{\fnArial\fs30}They used to throw themselves at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.74,0:32:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,献身于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}With smiles on their faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.97,0:32:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我猜这些年 没人对这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess these days, nobody gives a flying crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.94,0:32:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,荒郊野林的神感兴趣了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}About some backwoods-forest god, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.65,0:32:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 还不是因为他们砍了我的密林\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not since they cut down my forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.25,0:32:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,建了个南斯拉夫工厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}To build a yugo plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.52,0:32:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,时代在进步 小妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}March of progress, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.85,0:32:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多年来 我到处闲逛\N{\fnArial\fs30}For years now, i've been wandering.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.26,0:32:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,饥饿 恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hungry. scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.63,0:32:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,四处寻找残羹剩饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scrounging for scraps.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.70,0:32:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点惹人厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}So not sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.93,0:32:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.17,0:33:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,神奇的事情发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best thing ever happened …
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.27,0:33:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人开启了天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone tripped the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.57,0:33:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就想 搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thought, what the hell …
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.67,0:33:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够了以往的事物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired of watching what I eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.14,0:33:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要吃大餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to pig out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.41,0:33:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以就找到了这个小地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I found this little place.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.62,0:33:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.82,0:33:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,虔诚的粉丝蜂拥而至\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adoring fans stroll right in the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.29,0:33:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但他们不是你的粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. but they're not your fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.19,0:33:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.72,0:33:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们崇拜的是林肯 甘地 希尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}They worship lincoln, gandhi, hilton.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.66,0:33:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 我会拿走我能得到的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever. i'll take what I can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.53,0:33:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我告诉过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I got to tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.26,0:33:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是我们遇到的第一位神\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not the first god we've met,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.00,0:33:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你却是最狂热的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are the nuttiest.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.00,0:33:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是你们 你们人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. you. you people.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.70,0:33:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们才是疯狂的那类\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the crazy ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.31,0:33:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们曾经尊崇神灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used to worship gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.51,0:33:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但此时\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.81,0:33:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这被误认为什么偶像崇拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what passes for idolatry?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.15,0:33:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,社会名流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Celebrities?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.55,0:33:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们除了小狗和美容还有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have they got besides small dogs and spray tans?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.25,0:33:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们人类过去一直怀有旧式的宗教信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}You people used to have old-time religion.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.35,0:33:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在则是每周一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you have us weekly.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.99,0:33:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.42,0:33:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在“阁楼”（美国色情杂志论坛）论坛发了不少帖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm more of a penthouse forum man, myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.03,0:34:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是吧 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.30,0:34:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里仍有许多美味的肉在那些骨头上 帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still a lot of yummy meat on those bones, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.17,0:34:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我本不愿意向你透露实情的 美女 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hate to break it to you, sister, but, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.14,0:34:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能吃我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't eat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.61,0:34:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不是一个帕丽斯·希尔顿永远的最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, i'm not a paris hilton bff.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.58,0:34:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也从未看过“恐怖蜡像馆”\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never even seen "house of wax."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.38,0:34:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.48,0:34:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我可以完全看穿你的想法 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can totally read your mind, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.65,0:34:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道谁才是你的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who your hero is.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.52,0:34:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.72,0:34:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说对了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.56,0:34:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个曾属于他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this belonged to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.73,0:34:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.77,0:34:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的小迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor little dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.87,0:34:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有你曾经想要的就是被你的偶像所爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you ever wanted was to be loved by your idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.84,0:34:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个遥远的父亲形象正在升起\N{\fnArial\fs30}One distant father figure, coming right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.54,0:35:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也别说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.61,0:35:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.11,0:35:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚和帕丽斯·希尔顿过了一小段美好时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just got whaled on by paris hilton.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.22,0:35:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.30,0:35:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.00,0:35:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡内基警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff carnegie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.70,0:35:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹妮尔会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danielle's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.57,0:35:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已经离开“简单生活”\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's sworn off "the simple life, "
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.24,0:35:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但除此之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}But other than that…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.40,0:35:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴她没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad she's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.73,0:35:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,会转好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gets better …
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.47,0:35:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长已经发出对帕丽斯·希尔顿的全境通告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff's putting out an apb on paris hilton.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.81,0:35:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那应该有作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ought to be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.42,0:36:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我在想你昨天说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen, I was thinking about what you said yesterday …
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.92,0:36:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于我看你太紧了的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}About me keeping too tight of a leash on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.16,0:36:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.86,0:36:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 看 我也不并不是清白先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look, i'm not exactly mr. innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.90,0:36:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这整件事上\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this whole mess, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.37,0:36:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 是我打破了第一个封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I did break the first seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.07,0:36:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你当时并不知情 - 是的 你不也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You didn't know. - Yeah, well, neither did you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.97,0:36:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说恶魔血液是一个可行的好方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying demon blood was a great way to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.97,0:36:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你杀死了莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you did kill lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.84,0:36:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然而打开了天启 - 我们不也看到了未来么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And start the apocalypse. - Which neither of us saw coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.81,0:36:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 谁会想到杀死莉莉丝会有不好的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, who would've thought killing lilith would've bad day.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.65,0:36:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,重点是 我很担心监视你的一举一动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point is, I was so worried about watching your every move.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.42,0:36:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有看到你实际做的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I didn't see what it was actually doing to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.16,0:36:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以对此 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, for that, i'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.53,0:36:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.43,0:36:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从这里去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where do we go from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.03,0:36:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经看到了我们的生存之道\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way I see it, we got one shot at surviving this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.30,0:36:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.64,0:36:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概我为恶魔准备齐全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I am on deck for the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.84,0:36:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概你和米伽勒也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the same with you and michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.07,0:36:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许没有改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe there's no changing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.17,0:37:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还是很鼓舞人心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's encouraging.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.34,0:37:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不能撒手不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we can stop wringing our hands over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.55,0:37:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们抢先抓住任何在我们前面的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to just grab on to whatever's in front of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.72,0:37:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉它 打败它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kick its ass, and go down fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.42,0:37:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以继续搭伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get on board with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.76,0:37:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.26,0:37:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们要在同一水平上做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're gonna have to do it on the same level.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.50,0:37:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.03,0:37:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我们要离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say we get the hell out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.28,0:37:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想开车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.52,0:37:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.46,0:37:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我得打个小盹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I could, uh … I could use a nap.
